                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"389\" height=\"71\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">Routing BGP ada 2 Jenis:\n1. iBGP -&gt; antar AS yang SAMA -&gt; AD = 200\n2. eBGP -&gt; antar AS yang BEDA -&gt; AD = 20</text></svg>",
